{"id":"f79df9244d067310","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-min-entropy.md","title":"df-min-entropy","display":"df-min-entropy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-min-entropy","aliases":["28-df-min-entropy"],"display":"df-min-entropy","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 21.22; printed p.442; PDF p.468","source_printed_pages":"442","source_pdf_pages":"468","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-min-entropy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-min-entropy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-entropy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 21.22; printed p.442; PDF p.468"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"442"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"468"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log_2\">\\(\\log_2\\)</span> 为二底对数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\infty(X)\">\\(H_\\infty(X)\\)</span> 为最小熵；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[0,n]\">\\(k\\in[0,n]\\)</span> 的弱随机源集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_\\infty(X)\\coloneqq-\\log_2\\left(\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}\\Pr[X=x]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_\\infty(X)\\coloneqq-\\log_2\\left(\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}\\Pr[X=x]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):H_\\infty(X)\\ge k\\}=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\Pr[X=x]\\le2^{-k}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):H_\\infty(X)\\ge k\\}=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\Pr[X=x]\\le2^{-k}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限非空概率分布的最大点质量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,1]\">\\((0,1]\\)</span> 内，因此对数和定义值良定。定义 21.22 使用等价的最大实数刻画。新增前已查本书所有原子名与 MOC；提取器和 leftover hash lemma 都需要此独立节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega$ 为有限非空集合，$X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)$，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\log_2$ 为二底对数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\log_2","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\infty(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[0,n]","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\infty(X)\\coloneqq-\\log_2\\left(\\max_{x\\in\\Omega}\\Pr[X=x]\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):H_\\infty(X)\\ge k\\}=\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\{0,1\\}^n):\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\Pr[X=x]\\le2^{-k}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(0,1]","display":false}],"bytes":1165,"backlinks":[{"id":"b191494d56cdc254","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-min-entropy]]。$A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$\\mathbf1_A(x)$ 为集合指示函数。"},{"id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]，$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\{0,1\\}^j$ 上均匀分布，每次出现的源 $X$ 与种子 $U_d$ 相互独立。"},{"id":"8aebe42487aca071","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]；$\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-flat-source]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：熵与提取器：[[28-df-min-entropy]]、[[28-df-randomness-extractor]]、[[28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma]]。"},{"id":"97a794aef4eec69f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$，见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf"]}